          "text": "Right ankle tenderness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Tender over the ATFL and mildly tender over the CFL. Minimal tenderness directly over the tip/posterior edge of the lateral malleolus. No bony tenderness at the medial malleolus, base of the 5th metatarsal, or navicular. No tenderness at the syndesmosis or midfoot."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
